WEBVTT

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.080
Sunavalon can't be attacked.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.360
And when it's Link Summoned, it can't 
be used as Link Material that turn.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:22.000
0 ATK?  Something's up.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.210
I set a card and end my turn.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.030
Let me ask one thing.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:30.910
What happened to Ghost Girl?

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.600
Oh, that girl.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.260
I felt a kinship with 
her because of her name.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.940
Answer me seriously!

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.740
Revolver dealt with her personally.

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.490
She's now a part of the Tower of Hanoi.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.700
As data.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.400
You'll see her soon.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.270
Because you'll also be turned into data.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.450
Unforgivable!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.780
So what?

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.260
I'll defeat you!

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.960
Wonderful!

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:21.700
I run Across the universe

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:24.870
At the speed of light

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.740
Begin Loading

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.480
Open the door of dreams

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.050
VRAINS spreads

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.150
Believe in myself

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.690
VRAINS continues

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:46.000
The circuit draws the future

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:50.070
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:51.670
Access!

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:54.370
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:55.970
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.270
Link with my soul

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:01.040
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.780
Now Win the Race

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.620
Connected world

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:09.120
No matter when

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:12.490
Nothing is impossible

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:16.630
Strive for hope

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:21.210
And ride the wind!

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.910
My turn!  I draw!

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:45.520
I summon Trickstar Candina from my hand.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:52.520
When Candina is summoned, I add one 
Trickstar in my deck to my hand.

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:57.320
I activate the Field Spell, 
Trickstar Light Stage.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:02.790
It lets me add one Trickstar 
in my deck to my hand.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.850
When this card is added to 
my hand other than by a draw,

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:09.030
I can Special Summon it.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:12.280
Come out, Trickstar Lilybell!

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:13.620
Here I go!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:17.860
I activate my new Field Spell, 
Trickstar Light Arena!

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:24.680
I select one set spell or trap, 
and that card can't activate.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:28.480
It must be activated at the end of the 
turn, or it's returned to the hand.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:35.130
Oh my.  My set card is sealed away.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.930
There's more!

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:41.400
I activate the effects of two 
Trickstar Lycoris in my hand!

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.840
I Special Summon them and 
return Candina to my hand!

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.980
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:52.410
The summoning conditions are two Trickstars!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:56.050
I set two Trickstar Lycoris!

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.950
Link Summon!

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:02.230
Link 2 Trickstar Holly Angel!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.580
Holly Angel...

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:13.930
I know your ace monster's effects can 
deal damage and strengthen herself.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:17.380
Being too popular has its drawbacks.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:22.910
Due to Light Arena, I Special Summon one 
Trickstar that was used to Link Summon!

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.910
Return, Lycoris!

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:34.090
Since a Trickstar was Special Summoned next 
to Holly Angel's link, you take 200 damage!

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:41.100
Huh?  The tree...

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.350
Please continue.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.480
Here I go!

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:51.020
When a Trickstar deals effect damage, 
Holly Angel gains that amount in ATK!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.140
Holy Blessing!

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.750
Time to battle!

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:59.800
Lilybell's effect lets 
her attack you directly!

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:11.120
Since I took damage, Sunavalon 
Dryas's effect activates!

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:15.070
What?

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:19.930
Once per turn, I Special Summon 
a Sunvine Link Monster from

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.520
my Extra Deck next to its link.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:27.520
Appear, Link 1 Sunvine Gardna!

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:37.600
And I regain LP equal to 
the damage I took - 800 LP.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.300
Regain LP?

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:43.050
Your dueling is just like 
in the picture book.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:43.930
Picture book?

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.770
I know the origin of your name.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:51.000
The book's protagonist.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:55.470
The title is the same as 
your name - Blue Angel.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.200
So what?

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:01.420
Blue Angel.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:05.220
I read it.  It's a good book.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:11.190
The protagonist is an 
angel with a cold heart.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:14.700
So she's always alone.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.820
She pretends to like being alone.

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:23.200
But when she is, she cries in sadness.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:29.200
Her tears are deep blue, like the ocean.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:33.620
She's just like you, Aoi Zaizen.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:38.640
One day, evil forces attack her.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:43.840
But when her angel friends save 
her, she gradually learns kindness.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:49.520
Every time she defeats evil, 
she gains more angel friends.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:54.980
Every time she fights, she becomes more kind.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:07:00.530
But for some reason, she cries blue 
tears whenever she defeats evil.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:05.000
Eventually, they call her Blue Angel.

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:10.560
You identify yourself with her.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:15.170
Unable to fit in, you 
were always crying alone.

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:18.960
So you wanted to become the 
heroine that cried blue tears.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:23.780
And you'll make that come 
true in LINK VRAINS. Correct?

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:26.700
Was it fun to uncover my past?

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.500
Yes.  It gives me shivers.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.680
I wonder why?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.770
I feel sorry for you.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:36.770
You're just like the evil 
in the picture book.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.010
Me?

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:42.480
So just like in the book, 
Blue Angel will defeat you!

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.440
What an honor.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.840
I'm continuing the duel!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:52.490
Since Lilybell dealt you damage, I can 
add Lycoris from my graveyard to my hand!

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:56.170
Sunavalon Dryas's effect 
can only be used once.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.460
I'll deal you more damage than you regained!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:03.190
Holly Angel attacks Sunvine Gardna!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.770
Sunvine Gardna's effect.

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:13.140
Since it's linked to 
Sunavalon, damage decreases

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:16.830
by 800 for each of Sunavalon's links.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:20.980
The linked Sunavalon Dryas is Link 1.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.720
So the damage decreases by 800!

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:26.450
First he regains LP, now 
he's reducing damage?

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:34.890
1600 damage is reduced to 800.

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:40.570
And since Sunvine Gardna was 
destroyed, the battle is over.

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:43.570
I finally understand how your deck works.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.310
Please tell me.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:53.090
Sunavalon creates Sunvines to 
keep damage as low as possible.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.780
And Sunavalon can't be attacked.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:58.740
Your deck focuses on defense.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:01.060
"Focuses?"

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.660
I'd rather you call it an 
absolutely impenetrable defense.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:07.360
There are no absolutes in a duel.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.130
I will break it down!

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.860
Oh, can you?

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:18.140
I Special Summon Lycoris from my 
hand and return Lilybell to my hand!

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:20.690
Then I set one card!

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:28.250
Will that card open the door to my heart?

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:33.620
I'll make you come to your 
senses with a hard strike.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.010
Due to Light Arena's effect,

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:40.220
Spectre's set card will return to 
his hand at the end of the turn.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:44.600
He'll have five cards in his 
hand when he draws next turn.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.600
If I activate my Reincarnation I just set...

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:52.570
...Spectre will have to banish five cards 
from his hand and draw five new cards.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:56.540
So he'll take damage due to Lycoris's effect.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:10:01.280
He'll take 200 damage per 
card.  And he has five.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:05.690
And I have two Lycoris on my field.

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:08.160
For a total of 2000 damage.

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:13.780
Spectre takes damage even 
when he draws normally.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:17.460
With this combo, I'll seize victory!

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.300
I end my turn!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.950
Now choose!

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.880
I choose to activate, of course.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.400
Sunvine Burial!

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.380
Find them yet?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:54.850
No.  I don't see anyone.

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:58.000
Why do you think we're staying 
in this dangerous place?

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.500
Hurry up and find them!

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.810
Easier said than done...

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:08.050
But should we stay here?  The 
Knights of Hanoi will find us.

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:11.050
If they do, they'll turn us into data.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:13.520
Don't say things like that!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.580
Maybe they'll attack us from behind.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:18.770
Stop it!

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:25.050
You okay, Boss?

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.460
Be careful!

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:27.360
Hey you!

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.600
Gulp!

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.400
They're here!

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.290
We're sorry!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.230
It's just a kid.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:45.390
But since it's an avatar, he 
might be a middle-aged man.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.840
You're the Knights of Hanoi!  Duel me!

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.310
You're destroying my favorite world!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.650
I won't let you cause any more harm!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.170
I'm Playmaker!  Bring it on!

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.170
You're Playmaker?

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:02.840
That's right!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:04.390
I see.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:09.800
Even though you're just a kid, 
you want to protect LINK VRAINS.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:13.930
But he might be a middle-aged man.  Sniff.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:17.090
But you're still crying, Boss.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:23.330
It seems my tarnished soul 
still has some purity.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:34.470
Oh no!  Are you okay, kid?

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:36.570
What should we do, Boss?

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:39.440
I don't know.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.380
Boss!  Look!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:43.850
Are you okay?

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:45.580
Playmaker!

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.810
The real one!

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:49.530
This place is dangerous.

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.050
Log out immediately.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:52.620
But...

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.500
I know how you feel.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.930
Don't worry.  I promise to save LINK VRAINS.

00:12:57.930 --> 00:12:59.660
Trust me.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:04.140
Okay.  I trust you, Playmaker.

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:06.350
I'm counting on you!

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:12.420
I bet you thought you were cool just now.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.610
Be quiet.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.650
So cool...

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.240
You filmed him this time, right?

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:20.740
You idiot!  It's not too late!

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:22.060
Begin filming!

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:23.280
Yes sir!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.700
Huh?  He's not here.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.160
Find him!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:35.500
Sunvine Burial checks a 
set spell or trap card.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.900
If it's a trap card, it's banished.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:43.140
Along with all copies in your hand and deck.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:55.620
Your set card is Trickstar Reincarnation.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:14:01.510
You were going to combo it with 
Lycoris to deal me big damage.

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:05.610
That was a wonderful strategy.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:18.640
He saw through my plan!

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:25.310
Oh my.  The door to your 
heart opened before mine.

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:30.200
I can see what you've been hiding.

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:35.800
I see old, sepia-toned images.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:38.000
I see...

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:43.830
You're six years old, and you're crying 
in sadness because you lost your parents.

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:53.910
And every time you cried, your brother 
read you the Blue Angel book.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.160
Over and over.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.840
Oh, what a nice brother!

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:09.350
By losing your parents, sadness 
and loss are deep in your heart.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.890
But you treasure the 
fantasy world's hero and

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:19.230
her friends for healing your 
wounds and protecting you.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:26.250
And in the real world, your 
brother always protects you.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.140
Am I wrong?

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:33.670
You fear losing what you treasure.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:39.630
The imaginary angels...  The brother 
who gives you unconditional love...

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:46.540
But in the end, you'll lose 
everything in this duel.

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:50.490
With your defeat.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:54.000
My turn!  I draw-

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.580
At this moment, Lycoris's effect!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:16:00.840
For every card you add to your 
hand, you take 200 damage!

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:04.810
Since I have two Lycoris, 
you take 400 damage!

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.280
That was dangerous.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:15.020
Since I got rid of Reincarnation, 
I only took 400 damage.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:21.260
Since I took damage, Sunavalon 
Dryas's effect activates!

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:27.000
I Special Summon Sunvine Healer from 
my Extra Deck next to its link.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.680
Another weird creature.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:42.480
And I regain LP equal 
to one Lycoris's damage.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:46.650
Next, I activate Sunvine Healer's effect!

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:53.370
Since she's linked to Sunavalon, I 
regain 300 LP for each of its links.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:02.800
Since I dealt you damage, Holly 
Angel's effect activates!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.670
Holy Blessing!

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:09.980
There's Blue Angel!

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:12.530
Her opponent is Spectre.

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:17.930
Five and a half hours until the 
Tower of Hanoi is completed.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:19.720
Where's Yusaku?

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:24.120
He's heading towards the Tower of Hanoi.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.540
Chief Zaizen!

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:33.530
LINK VRAINS footage has been restored!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.010
What?

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.560
Someone is dueling!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:38.740
That's...

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.200
Aoi!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.100
She's fighting to protect LINK VRAINS.

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:44.440
Who's her opponent?

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.410
He's the one who defeated Kusanagi.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:52.380
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.480
Arrowheads confirmed.

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:57.610
The summoning conditions are two Plant-Types.

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:03.800
I set Sunvine Healer and Sunavalon 
Dryas in the Link Markers!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.620
Circuit combine!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:09.810
Link Summon!

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:15.050
Appear, Link 2 Sunavalon Dryades!

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:25.260
Sunavalon grew?

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:30.700
Just like your brother, 
this tree protects me.

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:34.760
I can't hear what they're saying.

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:38.920
You're the same as me.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:40.500
What do you mean?

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.500
You were also all alone.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.370
Why do you think that?

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:50.340
You said the Blue Angel 
book was a good story.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.340
Since you agree, there's only one answer.

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:57.060
If you're given love, that 
creates positive energy.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:19:01.820
But if you don't get love, it turns into 
hatred and creates destructive energy.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.570
That hatred is the source of your strength.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.080
You're a strange one.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:12.930
Why are you trying to figure me out?

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:15.410
Because I'm Blue Angel.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:19.000
I see what you're saying.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.390
You're no longer the Blue 
Angel who keeps crying.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:25.890
You've realized your true mission.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:29.350
It'd be nice if you can fulfill that mission.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.820
Here I go.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:36.250
I summon Sunseed Genius Loci!

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:43.200
Appear again!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.070
Will the tree grow again?

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:49.630
The summoning condition is one 
Plant-Type Normal Monster.

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:54.410
I set Sunseed Genius Loci in the Link Marker!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.580
Link Summon!

00:19:57.160 --> 00:20:00.910
Appear, Link 1 Sunvine Thrasher!

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:06.420
By linking to Sunavalon,

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:12.260
this monster gains 800 ATK for every 
one of Sunavalon's Link Markers.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:15.240
Sunavalon Dryades is Link 2.

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:19.440
Therefore, it gains 1600 ATK!

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:27.040
Unlike before, this Sunvine 
has an offensive effect.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:32.320
Let's battle!  Sunvine 
Thrasher attacks Holly Angel!

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:42.370
You're going for mutual destruction?

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.550
You wish.

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:47.160
When Thrasher destroys a monster in battle...

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.650
...it's Special Summoned 
next to Sunavalon's link.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.520
Holly Angel...

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:05.510
Resurrect to me, Holly Angel!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:21.100
Now let's watch a battle between Trickstars.

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:24.840
Holly Angel, attack Lycoris!

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:38.720
How does it feel to be attacked 
by your own ace monster?

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:41.380
I end my turn.

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.620
Sunavalon is clearly the 
core of Spectre's deck.

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:51.220
I want to destroy it, but 
Sunavalon can't be attacked.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:53.690
What can I do?

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:59.800
That's right!  With this...

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:15.710
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:22.850
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:30.080
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:37.430
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:44.670
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:48.820
There were fragments of power

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:56.000
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.230 --> 00:23:03.340
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:10.520
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:17.750
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.880 --> 00:23:24.630
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:32.300
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.600
Why must I suffer like this?

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:44.360
All alone, he cursed his destiny.

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:51.800
His desire for love went unfulfilled, 
transforming into hatred.

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:55.990
He wished for someone to save him.

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:59.520
This game must end immediately!

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:03.280
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Sacred Tree

00:24:03.280 --> 00:24:05.310
Into the VRAINS!
